{"version":1,"content":"<p>土耳其旅遊勝地卡帕多奇亞（Cappadocia）周四（29日）因暴雨引發山泥傾瀉，一座尖柱狀岩石倒塌，造成3人死亡，包括一名外國人；</p><p>另有5人受傷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:26:54.469395+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":74,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:51:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.391298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:04.578896+00:00","content_hash":"0edb01ed311ffcd3e1e0675feea29cbe09c0bb0d9bfb37576e65c2d6912ce106","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}